><p>IHC=immunohistochemistry; o/n=overnight; n/a=not applicable; conc=concentration.</p></fn><fn id="t1-fn2"><label>a</label><p>Antigen retrieval pH.</p></fn><fn id="t1-fn3"><label>b</label><p>Immunohistochemical score was calculated from percentage (0&#x02013;100) multiplied by intensity (0&#x02013;3) of expression for each marker studied &#x02013; 50th percentile (25 and 75th percentiles).</p></fn><fn id="t1-fn4"><label>c</label><p>Insufficient tissue available for scoring in some biopsies.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>